<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $1.00/1.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $1.00/1.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.25 lower. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     60.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     59.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     58.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-500 lbs .50-2.50 lower; 500-700 lbs steady to .50 higher. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>	   400-450 lbs	50.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	53.50-54.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	55.00</p>
</text>
